OL,3,GNEWSA'I can't see it stopping' -
OL,4,AMiddlesbrough's young people on gangs
OL,5,
OL,6,FInside Hemlington Boxing Club in
OL,7,FMiddlesbrough, music is drowned out by
OL,8,Fthe sound of gloves hitting pads.
OL,10,FFor young men here, nights in the ring
OL,11,Fare far better than the alternative.
OL,13,FBecause outside, away from the bright
OL,14,Flights of the gym, riders wearing
OL,15,Fbalaclavas roar past on quad bikes in
OL,16,Fthe darkness.
OL,18,F"You see it all the time," says Dylan,
OL,19,Fa 20-year-old who trains at the club.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
